  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PlacedProp
  spec: store_props
  yaw: 0
  rot0: {x: 0.000000021855694, y: -0, z: -0, w: 1}
  src: '{"name":"kevin_closet_door","floor":"upper","prefab":"Assets/Free Wood Door Pack/Prefab/Wood/Door_3/Door_3_White.prefab","x":[8.022,8.955],"z":[7.573,7.633],"y0":0.0,"height":2.087,"back":"+z","hides":["Casing"],"collide":false,"open":0,"hinge":"lo","source":"user walk note Oct 18 03:14 (foyer rear, shot 20261018-031353): ''these doors should all be replaced with real doors, the same doors used elsewhere inside'' (overnight 12, not walked). Door_3 White as the other interior doors (linen, girls_a/b, attic, Buzz, parents; the film''s are white six-panel: DEVIATIONS 63h). The pack frame (outer = leaf x 1.124 wide, x 1.027 tall) centred on the opening, 0.5 cm proud of the face, 6 cm deep. Opening x 8.074-8.904 (0.83 m, stock 32/33 in) had no leaf. Frame on Kevin''s room face (z 7.638), replacing its casing. Hinge ASSUMED at the lo end (x 8.074; the pack leaf''s own hinge edge as it turns here, yaw 180, so the lever is at the latch edge); swings into the closet (0.86 m deep, the 0.83 leaf clears); SHUT (Oct 18 dressing round: Marina 380/383 show it closed with the boxing gloves hung on its knob; was ajar 30, authored)."}'
  c0: {x: 8.488501, y: 1.0435, z: -7.6029997}
