  src: '{"name":"buzz_door","floor":"upper","prefab":"Assets/Free Wood Door Pack/Prefab/Wood/Door_3/Door_3_White.prefab","x":[7.4566,8.3704],"z":[11.365,11.425],"y0":0.0,"height":2.087,"back":"+z","hides":["Casing"],"open":80,"hinge":"lo","source":"user Oct 17 (in Buzz''s room facing its door): ''please place a real door like we have in other rooms upstairs in this opening, widening it if necessary'' (changes/2026-10-17-buzz-door.json). Door_3 White as girls_a/girls_b/attic/linen. Opening x 7.507-8.320 (stock 32 x 80 in leaf; Marina''s leaf 0.798 solve / 0.800 at the 560 s door ruler); the pack frame (outer = leaf x 1.124 wide, x 1.027 tall) replaces the generated casing on the hall face (z 11.43; 0.5 cm proud, 6 cm deep), its hi side 0.6 mm short of the hall corridor''s east wall (x 8.371). Hinge at the shelves end (lo, x 7.507): Marina 560/563 s show the knob at the bed-side edge (blind pick check). Swings into the room (her leaf sits by the room-side casing; standard; DEVIATIONS 73). Open 80 deg AUTHORED (her door is closed in every frame): toward the shelves wall, not flat against it"}'
  c0: {x: 7.9135003, y: 1.0435, z: -11.785048}
