  src: '{"name":"attic_door","floor":"upper","prefab":"Assets/Free Wood Door Pack/Prefab/Wood/Door_3/Door_3_White.prefab","x":[6.0647,6.9213],"z":[13.456,13.516],"y0":0.0,"height":2.087,"back":"+z","hides":["Casing"],"open":90,"hinge":"lo","swing":"out","source":"user, Oct 16: ''use that same door in the attic door casing and both girls rooms'' (Door_3 White, as the linen closet). Walk-through doorway; OPEN 90 again (Oct 18, attic shell TRIAL: the attic is built behind it; the user had closed it Oct 16 ''for now'': set open 0 to close); the pack frame (outer = leaf x 1.124 wide, x 1.027 tall) replaces the generated casing on the hall face (its renderer hidden, collider kept), 0.5 cm proud, 6 cm deep. Hinge side and swing are ASSUMED (nearest room corner; no frame shows them): hinge at x 6.112, swings OUT into hall_corridor_south: into the stair it would hit the first step (z 14.082, 0.42 m past the wall). Opening x 6.112-6.874."}'
