  src: '{"name":"kevin_door","floor":"upper","prefab":"Assets/Free Wood Door Pack/Prefab/Wood/Door_3/Door_3_White.prefab","x":[6.856,6.916],"z":[6.7063,7.5717],"y0":0.0,"height":2.087,"back":"+x","hides":["Casing"],"collide":false,"open":85,"hinge":"hi","source":"user walk note Oct 18 03:14 (foyer rear, shot 20261018-031353): ''these doors should all be replaced with real doors, the same doors used elsewhere inside'' (overnight 12, not walked). Door_3 White as the other interior doors (linen, girls_a/b, attic, Buzz, parents; the film''s are white six-panel: DEVIATIONS 63h). The pack frame (outer = leaf x 1.124 wide, x 1.027 tall) centred on the opening, 0.5 cm proud of the face, 6 cm deep. Opening z 6.754-7.524 (0.77 m, stock 30 x 80 in; spec/geometry.json kevin_jeff_room|hall_end) had no leaf. Frame on the hall_end face (x 6.921), replacing its casing. Hinge ASSUMED at the hi end (z 7.524, 0.11 m from the room''s north wall, x 7.061-7.638 corner): the open leaf rests along that wall. Swings into the room; open 85 deg AUTHORED (no leaf has collision: walking unchanged)."}'
