  src: '{"name":"rear_passage_side_door","prefab":"Assets/Free Wood Door Pack/Prefab/Wood/Door_3/Door_3_White.prefab","x":[1.9029,2.7571],"z":[8.86,8.92],"y0":0.0,"height":2.087,"back":"-z","hides":["PropDoor"],"collide":false,"surface":true,"source":"user walk note Oct 18 03:14 (foyer rear, shot 20261018-031353): ''these doors should all be replaced with real doors, the same doors used elsewhere inside'' (overnight 12, not walked). Door_3 White as the other interior doors (linen, girls_a/b, attic, Buzz, parents; the film''s are white six-panel: DEVIATIONS 63h). The pack frame (outer = leaf x 1.124 wide, x 1.027 tall) centred on the opening, 0.5 cm proud of the face, 6 cm deep. Replaces the PropDoor slab of the fake door on the rear passage''s south wall (rear_passage|back_hall, z 8.785, x 1.95-2.71: 0.76 m, stock 30 x 80 in). Closed (back_hall is closed, DEVIATIONS 22); on the passage face (z 8.855); surface."}'
