  src: '{"name":"guest_bed","floor":"upper","prefab":"Assets/Fadnn - Vintage Interior Furniture Pack/Props/Prefabs/HDRP/SM_Bed_01.prefab","x":[6.0,7.44],"z":[17.91,19.85],"y0":0.0,"height":1.24,"back":"+z","collide":true,"tint":[0.62,0.78,0.36],"tint_only":["M_Cloth","M_Pillow"],"source":"props lane (guest room TRIAL Oct 18, changes/2026-10-18-guest-room.json): the poster''s corner bedroom (IMG_4295 second-floor close-up) has a green double bed, head to the end wall, a nightstand beside it. Owned Fadnn SM_Bed_01 at 0.85 (1.44 x 1.94 x 1.24, as the attic''s), head 6.7 cm off the end wall (clear of the window stool, 0.79 m) under its window (the poster''s bed stands against the windowed end wall), centred on the window; bedding tinted the poster''s green (frame untouched). The film never shows this room. collide: one walk box (nothing hides under it in the film). yaw pinned 0 (walk note 12:18 ''the headboard is facing the wrong way''): the auto turn (180, vertex- and area-scored alike) put the pillows/tall posts away from the end wall.","yaw":0}'
