  src: '{"name":"attic_bed","floor":"upper","prefab":"Assets/Fadnn - Vintage Interior Furniture Pack/Props/Prefabs/HDRP/SM_Bed_01.prefab","x":[3.99,5.93],"z":[11.241,12.681],"y0":2.62,"height":1.24,"back":"-x","hides":["SofaBed","Mattress"],"collide":false,"source":"props lane (user Oct 18: ''replace the bed in the attic with an actual bed we might have as an asset''): Fadnn SM_Bed_01 (owned; 1.69 x 2.28 x 1.46) at 0.85 uniform (1.44 x 1.94 x 1.24, about a full, like the film''s 54x75 fold-out) so the headboard clears the 1.25 m knee wall''s slope; head to the rear knee wall in attic trial 2''s bed spot (the placeholder SofaBed/Mattress hidden; its walk collider stays). The film''s bed is a plaid fold-out sofa bed (1403-1447): no owned match. Moved Oct 18 (guest-room job, user: ''do whatever looks most faithful to the film...''): with the bed group to just past the well''s foot-end rail (film 1410/1418, Marina 841), near edge 0.90 m short of the rail, head still to the rear knee wall (reconcile.py attic bed box = this box). yaw pinned 90 (Oct 18): the auto turn (270) had the same flip as the guest bed: pillows and tall head posts toward the well rail.","yaw":90}'
  c0: {x: 4.9599996, y: 3.24, z: -11.9609995}
