  src: '{"name":"buzz_closet_door","floor":"upper","prefab":"Assets/Free Wood Door Pack/Prefab/Wood/Door_3/Door_3_White.prefab","x":[7.7558,8.6122],"z":[15.938,15.998],"y0":0.0,"height":2.087,"yaw":180,"back":"+z","surface":true,"hide_parts":["Knob"],"hides":[],"collide":false,"source":"props lane (overnight 9, Oct 18, not walked; user chose ''a, fake door that leads nowhere''): Buzz''s closet door, film 478/480/524/526 (changes/2026-10-18-buzz-closet-options.md option A). The pack''s Door_3 White (frame = the casing, as buzz_door) hung ON the desk wall''s face, no opening cut: a stock 30 x 80 in leaf (box 1.124 x 0.762 of the prefab''s width) at x 7.803-8.565 = 0.33-1.09 m from the shelves corner (film 526, poster ruler), 6 cm deep so the leaf''s room face is z 15.9704 (yaw 180: the prefab''s leaf half toward the wall). The pack''s lever handle and hinges are left out (hide_parts Knob): the film''s brass knob is hifi_buzz_props.py''s, through the Jordan poster''s ruler at 36 in. surface: openings.py makes it a mounted frame so the baseboard stops at it. Leads nowhere (the wall is exterior): DEVIATIONS."}'
  c0: {x: 8.184, y: 1.0435, z: -15.968}
