--- !u!114 &5079599870805240893
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 824037986001322487}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: de2b5d5ea06784d29910927b98e863a1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PlacedProp
  spec: store_props
  yaw: 270
  rot0: {x: -0, y: 0.7071068, z: -0, w: -0.7071068}
  src: '{"name":"front_door_wreath","prefab":"Assets/ChristmasTreeAndGarland/ChristmasTreeAndDecor/Prefabs/Wreath.prefab","x":[9.928,10.072],"z":[9.449,9.982],"y0":1.048,"height":0.689,"yaw":270,"hide_parts":[],"hides":["Leaves","Berries"],"collide":false,"source":"user Oct 17: \"can you replace the wreath on the front door with one from the christmas pack?\" Same pack as living_tree (AlterEgos; gitignored). Native size kept (scale 1): ring 0.534 m across (FrontDoor.glb''s generated wreath was ~0.51), the pack''s bow hangs below it (box 0.689 tall). Ring centred on the leaf at 1.47 m and z 9.7155 (hifi_door.py WC, film 10248); back 1 cm off the leaf''s frame front (x 10.082, hifi_door.py xd). Front = model +z (bow, baubles) turned to face the vestibule (-x): yaw 270. Hides the generated Leaves/Berries (kept in FrontDoor.glb as the fallback for a clone without the pack). Keep both bow LODs (its LODGroup shows Bow_LOD1 from ~2 m; deleting it left no bow from the foyer).","back":"+x","hung":true}'
  c0: {x: 10, y: -1.6335, z: -9.7155}
