  yaw: 0
  rot0: {x: 0.000000021855694, y: -0, z: -0, w: 1}
  src: '{"name":"living_tree","prefab":"Assets/ChristmasTreeAndGarland/ChristmasTreeAndDecor/Prefabs/ChristmasTree.prefab","x":[1.845,3.085],"z":[14.812,16.045],"y0":0.0,"height":1.7,"yaw":0,"hide_parts":["LightBulbs","LightCord"],"hides":[],"collide":false,"source":"user pick Oct 16: Asset Store ''Christmas Tree, Wreath, Adjustable Garland and Bubble Lights'' (AlterEgos; licensed for use, not redistribution: gitignored). Film 10600 / Marina f3, f165: the rear wall''s den-side corner by the fireplace. Box = the model''s own footprint (1.86 x 1.85 native, after its mini lights and cord are left out) at a uniform 0.667 scale (2.55 -> 1.70 m: film 10645, changes/2026-10-17-living-tree-height.json; was 2.40 authored). Its warm-white mini lights and cord are not the film''s (multicolour C7s): hifi_living.py puts C7 bulbs on its envelope. No bubble lights, wreath or garland: the film''s living room shows none (the front-door wreath is FrontDoor.glb''s). Collider: spec/dressing/living.json tree"}'
  c0: {x: 2.4650002, y: -2.176, z: -15.4285}
